  "description": "Manufacturer may substitute components with components of equal or greater performance level\n\nThe Nishiki Youth Colorado Mountain Bike will spark your sense of adventure and outdoor fun. It features a strong lightweight aluminum frame that uses 50mm of travel on the front suspension fork to deliver a smooth ride over trails and rough roads. It features a Shimano 1 x 7 speed drive train that delivers a reliable performance on both flat and hilly terrain. Mechanical disc brakes deliver great control over wet and dry conditions. This mountain bike provides wider, lightweight double wall aluminum 24\" multi terrain off-road tires for solid traction. This bike takes you anywhere, through trails or around town!\n\nFeatures:\n\nYouth performance mountain bike\n\nLightweight 6061 aluminum frame with internal cables and replaceable derailleur hanger\n\nSturdy aluminum construction offers long-term durability\n\nMechanical disc brakes offer reliable stopping power\n\nLightweight double wall aluminum rims with 24 x 2.35” multi-terrain tires offer reliable stopping power\n\nNishiki coil spring suspension fork with 50mm travel\n\nShimano 1 x 7 speed drivetrain helps to provide smooth and efficient gear changes\n\nBike weighs approximately 33 lbs.",
